			(property "Description" "Momentary Switch (Pushbutton) - SPST - w/ LED\n\nNormally-open (NO) SPST momentary switches (buttons, pushbuttons), with a built-in LED.\n\nVariants PTH-CHERRY - Cherry MX Switch\n\nCherry MX Keyswitches are top-of-the-line mechanical keyboard switches. They’re satisfyingly “clicky”, reliable up to tens-of-millions of key presses, and a standard in gaming and programming keyboards across the globe. This ‘blue’ version Cherry MX Switch is favored by most due to its secondary internal actuator making it less likely to “double-tap.” If you are looking for a noticeably audible and high-quality key switch, this is the perfect option for you!\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13834 Cherry MX Switch (COM-13834)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13773 Cherry MX Switch Breakout (BOB-13773)\n\nPTH-12MM and PTH-12MM-KIT - 12mm Illuminated LED\n\nKIT variant is for soldering kits. There is no tStop (covering up the top side of the pads with mask). This helps the beginner see which side they should be soldering too.\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10467 LED Tactile Button Breakout (BOB-10467)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10442 LED Tactile Button - Red (COM-10442)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10443 LED Tactile Button - Blue (COM-10443)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10440 LED Tactile Button - Green (COM-10440)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10441 LED Tactile Button - Orange (COM-10441)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10439 LED Tactile Button - White (COM-10439)"
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
				)
